<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux China venture wins concession.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux China venture wins concession.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A joint venture between Generale des Eaux and Tianjin Waterworks has been awarded a 20-year concession to run a drinking water plant in Tianjin, south east of the capital, Generale des Eaux said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the plant, which serves a third of the nine million inhabitants, had a turnover of $18 million and that the joint venture, CGE Tianjin, planned to invest $30 million.</p>
<p>CGE holds 55 percent of CGE Tianjin.</p>
<p>(( -- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452))</p>
</text>
